  "title": "Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope Launches",
  "summary": "NASA’s Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope, a $4.3 billion dark energy-hunting space telescope, has successfully launched from Florida, marking the start of a three-month mission to explore the universe’s darkest secrets. The telescope will now conduct an unprecedented survey of the universe, including a field of view of one million miles, from the second Sun-Earth Lagrange point beyond the Moon.",
